@startuml
<style>
timingDiagram {
  .st { LineColor red }
}
</style>
compact robust "R" as R <<st>>
compact concise "C" as C <<st>>
compact binary "B" as B <<st>>
compact analog "A" between 0 and 10 as A <<st>>
compact clock Clk with period 10 <<st>>
@0
R is a
C is b
B is high
A is 2
@10
R is c
C is d
B is low
A is 8
@20
@enduml
